This file contains the change history for the Telnet application.

Not all of these releases were made public, but their changes are listed
for reference.

People who assisted with new information on a bug are listed in brackets.

----------------------
v1.0.3 - 17th May 2003
----------------------

- "Opening Connection..." text was not being displayed for non-DNR
 connections - fixed (Andrew Roughan)

--------------------------
v1.0.2 - 20th October 2002
--------------------------

- When the connection was closing, an endless loop was entered if the status
 of the connection was already tcpsCLOSED. Exit logic now checks for this and
 aborts cleanly if it is found - (Andrew Roughan)

---------------------------
v1.0.1 - 2nd September 2002
---------------------------

- Initial release as open source

=END=
